    <briefdescription>
<para>Cached diagonal plane-wave multipole-to-local translation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Uses C_XL D C_MX from <ref refid="bibliography_1ref_greengard1997" kindref="member">Greengard and Rokhlin (1997)</ref>. The quadrature axis follows the separation; coefficient storage is Cartesian. </para>
